{"id":1061301,"name":"霽川・取り調べⅠ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"霽川・取り調べⅠ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1061301]}],"trial":{"trial_id":61301,"stage":"段階1","unlock_time":"2026-05-07 14:00:00","diary1":"東洲からディスへ戻ってからも、あなたは霽川の消息を探し続けた。彼女が残したあの枯れた梅の枝は、今もあなたの執務室の花瓶に挿されたままだ。\n　「朔荒の侠者」に関する調査は各方面から終結を求められている。しかし朔雪山荘の荘主の生死と行方は、今なおアーカイブ上で空白のままなのである。","diary2":"東洲より、霽川の行方に関する手掛かりが届いた。たとえ微かな望みであっても、あなたは向かうことを決めた。\n　瓶に挿された枯れた梅の枝には、いつの間にか小さな新芽が芽吹いている。まるで遠方で風雪が吹き荒れ始め、生き延びた何かの命が静寂の中で目覚めようとしているかのように。","evidence":[{"ID":260895,"Num":1},{"ID":260897,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260896,"Num":1},{"ID":260898,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161301022,"next